<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 4 章 · 动作组</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>三个辅助函数</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：三函数卡 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>print_group(start, end)</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
          由 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>$PTG:x-y!</span> 调用。从 Flash 逐组 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>w25x_read</span> 并通过串口1发回，用于「校验存得对不对」。start&gt;end 时自动交换。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>rewrite_eeprom()</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
          把 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>eeprom_info</span>（偏差值/预置命令）整体写回 Flash 固定地址：先 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>w25x_erase_sector</span> 再 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>w25x_writeS</span>。调偏差、设开机动作组时都会调用。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,191,36,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 20px', borderLeft: '4px solid #FBBF24' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FBBF24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>replace_char(str, ch1, ch2)</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 6 }}>
          把字符串里所有 ch1 替换为 ch2。save_action 用它把 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>&lt; &gt;</span> 换成 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>{ }</span>，回放时就能被 parse_action 当「多路帧」原样解析——这是「存动作组」巧思的关键。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>31 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
